{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36652","headline":"重过随州故兵部李侍郎恩知因抒长句 · 罗隐","name":"重过随州故兵部李侍郎恩知因抒长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庄周高论伯牙琴，闲夜思量泪满襟。\n四海共谁言近事，九原从此负初心。\n鸥翻汉浦风波急，鴈下郧溪雾雨深。\n慙媿苍生还有意，解歌襦袴至如今。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36652.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36652","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}